  "Specification": "Voucher redemption transaction protocol (VTP). Models a voucher holder (H), consumer (C), and voucher (V) coordinating through prepared/redeem/abort messages. A voucher transitions from valid to redeemed upon successful redemption. Proves type safety, consistency (no holder redeemed while consumer aborted or vice versa), and refinement of the VoucherLifeCycle specification.",
